&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive hands-on delivery of core product features supporting our enterprise delivery partnership with ENGIE in France.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate overarching product strategy and vision into detailed functional requirements, clear user stories, and actionable product roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional engineering, design, and delivery teams to manage product backlogs and execute sprint cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively manage dual-stakeholder relationships across internal teams and ENGIE client leads using fluent French and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse operational data, feature feedback, and platform metrics to continually refine and scale product capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional bilingual fluency (written and spoken) in both English and French.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working at scale, managing complex systems, high-volume data, or enterprise platform integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on product execution experience, showing proficiency with modern tools (e.g., Jira, Confluence, product analytics tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills with a track record of building trust across internal teams and enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience translating product vision into prioritised, well-defined roadmaps and delivery backlogs using Agile methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience within SaaS platforms, the energy sector, or large-scale utility migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience executing integration projects with major international energy players like ENGIE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leveraging AI tools, machine learning capabilities, or LLM integrations within product workflows to enhance platform intelligence and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience defining, prioritising, and delivering complex API integrations for large-scale enterprise platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with a requirement of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
